lvr2 source packaging
=====================

This source package keeps the historical lvr2 Debian and ROS identities. The
normal upstream build is vcpkg-first, but Debian source builds intentionally use
system packages through `-DLVR2_WITH_VCPKG=OFF` in `debian/rules`.

Do not reintroduce vendored dependency trees or install vendored dependency
artifacts from this source package. Static LVR archives are not installed by the
current Debian development packages because required private mesh asset I/O is
packaged through shared libraries to avoid exposing the private Assimp backend
through static target interfaces.
